#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:1
msgid "Q-Diffusion for Protein Sequence Generation"
msgstr "Q-Diffusion 蛋白质序列生成"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:3
msgid ""
"This case study applies the Q-Diffusion framework to protein sequence "
"generation. It demonstrates how DPLM (Protein Language Model) proposal "
"models are combined with a BM energy reranker to improve generated sequence "
"quality. For the overall model hierarchy and how Q-Diffusion fits into KPP's"
" architecture, see [Architecture Overview](architecture_overview.md)."
msgstr ""
"本案例研究将 Q-Diffusion 框架应用于蛋白质序列生成。它展示了如何将 DPLM（蛋白质语言模型）提议模型与 BM "
"能量重排序器相结合，以提升生成序列的质量。关于整体模型层次结构以及 Q-Diffusion 如何融入 KPP "
"架构，请参阅[架构概览](architecture_overview.md)。"

