#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:118
msgid "2. The QDiffusion Model"
msgstr "2. Q-Diffusion 模型"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:120
msgid ""
"`build_qdiffusion` returns the core `kaiwu.torch_plugin.QDiffusion` wrapper."
" Its constructor wires the four parts:"
msgstr ""
"`build_qdiffusion` 返回核心 `kaiwu.torch_plugin.QDiffusion` 包装器。其构造函数组装以下四个部分："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:126
msgid ""
"**proposal_model**: the frozen DPLM backbone that predicts token logits "
"(`freeze_proposal=True` freezes it here)."
msgstr ""
"**proposal_model**：冻结的 DPLM 骨干网络，用于预测 token logits（此处 `freeze_proposal=True`"
" 将其冻结）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:127
msgid ""
"**energy_model**: the trainable BM energy reranker that scores candidates."
msgstr "**energy_model**：可训练的 BM 能量重排序器，为候选序列打分"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:128
msgid ""
"**token_spec**: special-token metadata (`mask_id`, `pad_id`, `bos_id`, "
"`eos_id`)."
msgstr "**token_spec**：特殊 token 元数据（`mask_id`、`pad_id`、`bos_id`、`eos_id`）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:129
msgid ""
"**config**: a `QDiffusionConfig` with generation and training defaults."
msgstr "**config**：携带生成与训练默认值的 `QDiffusionConfig`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:131
msgid "The wrapper exposes both training and decoding APIs:"
msgstr "该包装器同时提供训练与解码 API："

