#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:157
msgid "3. The EnergyModel Interface"
msgstr "3. EnergyModel 接口"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:159
msgid ""
"The energy side is the `kaiwu.torch_plugin.EnergyModel` interface. Its "
"scoring chain turns token candidates into BM-space energies:"
msgstr "能量侧是 `kaiwu.torch_plugin.EnergyModel` 接口。其打分链将 token 候选转换为 BM 空间能量："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:165
msgid ""
"**Discretize**: `discretize_visible_state` maps visible logits to BM visible"
" conditions via sigmoid."
msgstr "**离散化**：`discretize_visible_state` 通过 sigmoid 将可见 logits 映射为 BM 可见条件。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:166
msgid ""
"**Sample**: `sample_hidden_state` draws BM hidden states with "
"`condition_sample` for each visible assignment."
msgstr "**采样**：`sample_hidden_state` 对每个可见赋值使用 `condition_sample` 采样 BM 隐藏态。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:167
msgid "**Score**: the BM energy of each full state is averaged per candidate."
msgstr "**打分**：每个完整状态的 BM 能量按候选平均。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:168
msgid ""
"**Diagnose**: `get_last_stats` returns sampling diagnostics (visible/hidden "
"on-ratios)."
msgstr "**诊断**：`get_last_stats` 返回采样诊断（可见/隐藏开启比例）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:170
msgid ""
"`score_conditioned` is the abstract entry point; subclasses implement it. "
"This example uses `BMConditionedEnergyModel`, which bridges token space to "
"BM space and then calls the chain above:"
msgstr ""
"`score_conditioned` 是抽象入口；由子类实现。本示例使用 `BMConditionedEnergyModel`，它将 token "
"空间桥接到 BM 空间，然后调用上述打分链："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:176
msgid ""
"The scoring chain is backend-agnostic: the hidden-state sampler is supplied "
"at construction time, so the same interface supports classical and quantum "
"samplers."
msgstr "打分链与后端无关：隐藏态采样器在构造时提供，因此同一接口同时支持经典与量子采样器。"

