msgstr "损失：能量目标的均值，通过重排序器反向传播"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:191
msgid "5. Generation and Evaluation"
msgstr "5. 生成与评估"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:193
msgid ""
"The generation loop samples from the proposal model and reranks with energy:"
msgstr "生成循环从提议模型中采样，并按能量重新排序："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:199
msgid "Training and Evaluation"
msgstr "训练 和 评估"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:201
msgid "**Training curves**: energy objective loss over epochs."
msgstr "**训练曲线**：各 epoch 的能量目标损失。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:202
msgid ""
"**Generated samples**: protein sequences generated by the guided workflow."
msgstr "**生成样本**：由引导工作流生成的蛋白质序列。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:203
msgid ""
"**ESM2 distance**: cosine and L2 distances between generated and reference "
"proteome embeddings."
msgstr "**ESM2 距离**：生成序列与参考蛋白质组嵌入之间的余弦距离和 L2 距离。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:204
msgid ""
"**Baseline vs guided**: compare baseline (DPLM only) vs guided (DPLM + BM "
"reranker) quality."
msgstr "**基线 vs 引导**：比较基线（仅 DPLM）与引导（DPLM + BM 重排序器）的质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:208
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "总结"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:210
msgid ""
"Q-Diffusion combines DPLM proposal models with BM energy reranking for "
"protein generation."
msgstr "Q-Diffusion 将 DPLM 提议模型与 BM 能量重排序相结合，用于蛋白质生成。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:211
msgid ""
"The energy reranker is trained on top of a frozen protein language model."
msgstr "能量重排序器在冻结的蛋白质语言模型之上训练。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qdiffusion.md:212
msgid ""
"Guided generation improves sequence quality measured by ESM2 embedding "
